  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The gate of the park clicks shut behind you. The sun has finally set,
    and for the first time in a long time, the air feels cold\u2014and that\u2019s
    okay. The world doesn't look like a masterpiece today; it looks like a Tuesday.
    There are bills to pay, awkward conversations to have, and a bed that feels a
    little too empty. But as you walk down the street, the camera hanging around
    your neck feels lighter. You haven't 'cured' your grief\u2014you\u2019ve simply
    integrated it. Grandma is gone, and the future is a terrifying, blank roll of
    film, unexposed and uncertain. But as you look at the city lights beginning to
    flicker on, you realize that you don't need to see the whole picture anymore.
    You just need to be there to witness the next frame. You take a breath. A real
    one. And you keep walking."
